20/03/2026

Additions:
Added BigFunctions.c and .h which will be used for non standard (+, -, *, /) operations on BigIntegers.
Added divisor to divmod128 to allow for division by any given uint64_t.
Added exp_big_integers which allows a BigInteger to be exponented to another BigInteger.
Added bigint_num_digits which returns the amount of digits required to represent the BigInteger.

Modifications:
Renamed IntegerOperations to BlockOperation to better reflect the code's purpose.
Added new methods to the DOCUMENTATION as appropriate.
Added the new BigFunctions file as a seperate section in the DOCUMENTATION.
Added deep_copy_big_integer to BigInteger.h since it used by BigFunctions and may be useful for other external uses.

Fixes:
Freed deepcopy "count" on fact_big_integers and "mul_val" in exp_big_integer, avoiding memory leak.